# Example secrets manifest. This file is committed only as documentation.
#
# The REAL manifest lives per-machine at $TOOLBELT_SECRETS
# (default ~/.config/toolbelt/secrets) and is never committed. You normally
# don't edit it by hand — `store-secret NAME value` creates and maintains it.
#
# Format: one env-var name per line. Each is loaded from the macOS Keychain
# (service name == the env-var name) and exported on shell startup.
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN
# OPENAI_API_KEY
# LINEAR_API_KEY
